title: '2026-11-14, third: ''C-c v o'' cycles a view among every author whose overrides would draw it otherwise, the root included, and names each; on main.'
pid: b3000a71-d4c0-4c90-83be-d3e44ef484ab
body: |2-
  Your second mission for the switch, with Jeff's two later decisions
  (the set recomputed at each press; the root too) and his rebinding of
  'skg-set-editable'. All built and tested in the server, both clients
  and skg-for-ai; reviewed; 'cargo build --release' run last. The
  decisions and their reasons are under my "A view follows the overrides
  of its root's author, unless it is switched to another author's
  perspective" ([[id:64a8d27d-4356-42ba-a6a6-93101b273597][that note]]).
